A multi-line frontmatter value renders with its newline collapsed to a space, so one row stays
one line and the table keeps exactly three lines for one match.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/one/index.md --
---
title: One
summary: |-
  first
  second
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --glob 'plans/*/index.md'
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
| title | summary | path | slug |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| One | first second | plans/one/index.md | one |
-- stderr --
